1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"eyebrow":"Learn, understand and practise","title":"Online Islamic Studies for Kids","description":"Live age-appropriate Islamic Studies classes for children covering essential beliefs, worship, duas, Seerah, manners and everyday Muslim practice.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Islamic Studies for Kids"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Online Islamic Studies that connects knowledge with a child's daily life"}],[["$","p","Children need more than a list of facts to memorize. They benefit from clear explanations, stories, examples and questions that connect Islamic learning with prayer, family life, honesty, kindness and personal responsibility. QuranCrest's online Islamic Studies classes organize essential topics into manageable lessons for the child's level.",{"children":"Children need more than a list of facts to memorize. They benefit from clear explanations, stories, examples and questions that connect Islamic learning with prayer, family life, honesty, kindness and personal responsibility. QuranCrest's online Islamic Studies classes organize essential topics into manageable lessons for the child's level."}],["$","p","A starting conversation checks age, previous learning, the family's priorities and the language the child understands best. The tutor can then select an appropriate sequence instead of giving a young beginner the same explanation as an older child who has already studied the basics.",{"children":"A starting conversation checks age, previous learning, the family's priorities and the language the child understands best. The tutor can then select an appropriate sequence instead of giving a young beginner the same explanation as an older child who has already studied the basics."}],["$","p","The curriculum can include essential beliefs, pillars of Islam and Iman, cleanliness and worship, daily duas, selected Seerah, Prophets' stories, manners and age-appropriate questions. Detailed religious rulings should be taught carefully by a qualified teacher and discussed with the family when scholarly approaches differ; this course page is not a substitute for an individual fatwa.",{"children":"The curriculum can include essential beliefs, pillars of Islam and Iman, cleanliness and worship, daily duas, selected Seerah, Prophets' stories, manners and age-appropriate questions. Detailed religious rulings should be taught carefully by a qualified teacher and discussed with the family when scholarly approaches differ; this course page is not a substitute for an individual fatwa."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Understand essential Islamic concepts in age-appropriate language",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L11"," ","Understand essential Islamic concepts in age-appropriate language"]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c",["$L1d","$L1e"],false,"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"],"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]
